  "Concert : groupe 5 musiciens": ["Concert: 5-piece band", "Concierto: grupo de 5 músicos", "Konzert: Band mit 5 Musikern", "Concerto: band di 5 musicisti"],
  "Scène 6×4, batterie sur riser, backline, retours amplifiés, side-fills, front fills, façade + subs, 2 tentes de régie (Yamaha CL3 et QuickQ 20), Rio3224, flight-cases, passage de câbles et patch type.": ["6×4 stage, drums on riser, backline, powered monitors, side-fills, front fills, main PA + subs, 2 control tents (Yamaha CL3 and QuickQ 20), Rio3224, flight cases, cable ramp and typical patch.", "Escenario 6×4, batería en tarima, backline, monitores amplificados, side-fills, front fills, PA principal + subs, 2 carpas de control (Yamaha CL3 y QuickQ 20), Rio3224, flight cases, pasacables y patch tipo.", "Bühne 6×4, Schlagzeug auf Podest, Backline, aktive Monitore, Side-Fills, Front-Fills, Main-PA + Subs, 2 Regiezelte (Yamaha CL3 und QuickQ 20), Rio3224, Flightcases, Kabelbrücke und typischer Patch.", "Palco 6×4, batteria su pedana, backline, monitor amplificati, side-fill, front fill, PA main + sub, 2 tende di regia (Yamaha CL3 e QuickQ 20), Rio3224, flight case, passacavi e patch tipo."],
